        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lou Cutell, Robert Gaffney, Marilyn Hanold, James Karen\n- Works: How I Met Your Mother, \"Last Time in New York\", Frankenstein Meets the Space Monster\n- Organizations: CBS\n- Topics: film, television\n\nFacts:\n- Lou Cutell was born on October 6, 1930, and he is an American movie and television actor.\n- Frankenstein Meets the Space Monster is a 1965 science fiction cult film directed by Robert Gaffney and starring Marilyn Hanold, James Karen, and Lou Cutell.\n- \"Last Time in New York\" is the third episode of the ninth season of the CBS sitcom How I Met Your Mother, and it is the 187th episode overall.\n- In 2013, Lou Cutell appeared in the How I Met Your Mother episode \"Last Time in New York\".",
